    "adaptiveInterior":"radius2 interior AND localRiskPixel <= 9.5367431640625e-7; the comparison is inclusive.",
    "adaptiveReconstruction":"the radius2 reconstructed float32 RGBA at adaptive-interior pixels; all excluded registered owner pixels fail closed into adaptive boundary.",
    "subsetInvariants":["radius3 interior is a subset of radius2 interior","adaptive interior is a subset of radius2 interior","adaptive rejected and adaptive interior partition radius2 interior"]
  },
